I find a place right by the water.
I sit down.
The water is grey and calm.
I look at the river.
I look to the left.
A tourist boat goes past.
The people on the boat wave.
I wave back.
I look straight ahead.
People are sitting on the other side.
They are sitting on a bench.
They are drinking coffee and talking.
It is very peaceful here.
I have no appointment today.
I have no destination today.
I simply have time.
I am just sitting here and looking.
